---
import Section from 'components/layout/section/Section.astro';
import Link from 'ui/base/link/Link.astro';

const JOURNAL_URL = 'https://www.instagram.com/chrobok.dev/';
---

<Section id="about">
  <h2 slot="label">About</h2>

  <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-section">
    <div class="space-y-tight">
      <h3 class="text-2xl">Teaching</h3>

      <p>
        I&rsquo;ve been teaching for a decade &mdash; maths and programming &mdash; which taught me to explain hard
        things simply and to work with people. Maths tutoring came first and still runs alongside the day job; later I
        spent two and a half years running robotics classes, where children built a machine out of LEGO and then wrote
        the program that made it move. Both are the same craft: take something that looks impenetrable, find the
        sentence that makes it obvious, and watch for the moment it lands. It is also where debugging became a habit
        &mdash; run it, compare what happened against what was meant to happen, change one thing at a time.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-element">
      <div class="space-y-tight">
        <h3 class="text-2xl">Developer&rsquo;s journal</h3>

        <p>
          Since January 2023 I&rsquo;ve kept a daily developer&rsquo;s journal &mdash; what I worked on, what broke,
          what I would do differently &mdash; documenting the road from Zero to Senior Developer. Consistency is the
          part that counts: an entry every day, including the days with nothing impressive to report.
        </p>
      </div>

      <Link variant="bordered" href={JOURNAL_URL} external>Journal on Instagram</Link>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
